  "summary": "The published base means identify HT125IBM (GSM6062950) as the excluded male pure-Iberian pig. Of the 51 genes in S4, 43 have published registered effects. All 43 agree in direction, but only HROB meets the paper’s significance rule in the registered analysis. A separate 19-animal genotype-only DESeq2 reconstruction recovered 49 of the 51 calls with no additional calls. The proposal passed validation, and no ledger was edited. [Published study and supplements](https://journals.plos.org/plosone/article?id=10.1371/journal.pone.0272775)",
